6. Liability
   As the Software is provided free of charge, the Licensor is liable only
   for intent and gross negligence (Sec. 521 German Civil Code, BGB). For
   defects of title and material defects, the Licensor is liable only if a
   defect was fraudulently concealed (Sec. 523, 524 BGB). These limitations
